    summary: "ELVN-002 is an oral small-molecule kinase inhibitor (irreversible) from Enliven Therapeutics. A selective, irreversible HER2 inhibitor active against HER2 mutations including exon 20 insertions. Its furthest stage is phase 1, for HER2-mutant non-small cell lung cancer, HER2-positive breast cancer and HER2-positive gastric and colorectal cancer. ClinicalTrials.gov registers it in 2 studies linked below. Company: \"In May 2025, we made the decision to explore strategic alternatives for ELVN-002 so that we could prioritize relcobatinib.\" Both phase 1 trials active, not recruiting. Whether it works in people has not been established unless a trial below reports it.",
